sequenceDiagram
    participant ONG as 🏢 ONG
    participant APP as 📱 Web ONG<br/>(Angular)
    participant GATEWAY as 🌐 API Gateway
    participant CAMPAIGN as 🎯 Campaign Service
    participant AUTH as 👤 User/Auth Service
    participant NOTIF as 🔔 Notification
    participant ADMIN as ⚙️ Admin Portal
    participant DB as 🗄️ PostgreSQL
    
    Note over ONG,DB: 1️⃣ INSCRIPTION ONG
    ONG->>APP: Cliquer "S'inscrire"
    APP->>APP: Formulaire: nom, email, docs
    ONG->>APP: Upload: Statuts juridiques, RCCM
    APP->>GATEWAY: POST /auth/register-ong<br/>{name, email, docs}
    GATEWAY->>AUTH: Créer profil ONG<br/>status = "PENDING"
    AUTH->>DB: INSERT users (type='ONG')<br/>verification_status='PENDING'
    AUTH->>AUTH: Générer verification_token
    AUTH-->>GATEWAY: ONG_ID, token
    GATEWAY->>AUTH: Injecter docs dans bucket storage
    GATEWAY-->>APP: "Inscription soumise"
    APP-->>ONG: "En attente validation admin"
    
    Note over ONG,DB: 2️⃣ ADMIN VALIDE PROFIL ONG
    ADMIN->>ADMIN: Dashboard: Lister ONG PENDING
    ADMIN->>GATEWAY: GET /admin/ong/pending
    GATEWAY->>AUTH: Fetch ONG en attente
    AUTH->>DB: SELECT * FROM users<br/>WHERE type='ONG' AND status='PENDING'
    DB-->>AUTH: Liste ONG + docs
    AUTH-->>GATEWAY: {ong_list}
    GATEWAY-->>ADMIN: Affiche: Nom, docs, email
    ADMIN->>GATEWAY: POST /admin/ong/validate/{ong_id}<br/>{action: 'APPROVE', comment: 'OK'}
    GATEWAY->>AUTH: Mettre à jour profil ONG
    AUTH->>DB: UPDATE users SET<br/>verification_status='VERIFIED'
    NOTIF->>NOTIF: Queue event: "ong_verified"
    NOTIF-->>ONG: Email: "Profil validé!"
    
    Note over ONG,DB: 3️⃣ ONG CRÉE UN PROJET
    ONG->>APP: Cliquer "Créer Projet"
    APP->>APP: Formulaire: Titre, description,<br/>budget, bénéficiaires, urgence
    ONG->>APP: Upload: Photos, vidéos, docs proof
    APP->>GATEWAY: POST /campaigns/create<br/>{title, description, budget,<br/>beneficiary_count, files}
    GATEWAY->>CAMPAIGN: Créer campagne<br/>status='DRAFT'
    CAMPAIGN->>CAMPAIGN: Valider champs requis
    CAMPAIGN->>DB: INSERT campaigns<br/>status='SUBMITTED_FOR_REVIEW'
    CAMPAIGN-->>GATEWAY: campaign_id
    GATEWAY-->>APP: "Projet soumis"
    APP-->>ONG: "En attente validation"
    
    Note over ONG,DB: 4️⃣ ADMIN VALIDE PROJET
    ADMIN->>ADMIN: Dashboard: Lister projets PENDING
    ADMIN->>GATEWAY: GET /admin/campaigns/pending
    GATEWAY->>CAMPAIGN: Fetch campaigns<br/>status='SUBMITTED_FOR_REVIEW'
    CAMPAIGN->>DB: SELECT * FROM campaigns<br/>WHERE status='SUBMITTED_FOR_REVIEW'
    DB-->>CAMPAIGN: Projets + bénéficiaires
    CAMPAIGN-->>GATEWAY: {campaign_list}
    GATEWAY-->>ADMIN: Affiche détails + impact potentiel
    
    ADMIN->>GATEWAY: POST /admin/campaigns/validate/{campaign_id}<br/>{action: 'APPROVE',<br/>impact_score: 8.5}
    GATEWAY->>CAMPAIGN: Valider campagne
    CAMPAIGN->>DB: UPDATE campaigns<br/>SET status='ACTIVE'
    CAMPAIGN->>DB: Calc: eligible_donors<br/>= géolocalisation + préférences IA
    CAMPAIGN->>GATEWAY: {campaign_id, active}
    GATEWAY->>NOTIF: Queue: "campaign_activated"<br/>{campaign_data, eligible_donors_count}
    NOTIF->>NOTIF: Tâche async: Notifier donateurs<br/>push + email targeting
    NOTIF-->>ONG: Email: "Projet activé!"<br/>Eligible donors: 250+
    
    Note over ONG,DB: 5️⃣ REJET (Alternative)
    ADMIN->>GATEWAY: POST /admin/campaigns/validate/{campaign_id}<br/>{action: 'REJECT',<br/>reason: 'Docs insuffisants'}
    GATEWAY->>CAMPAIGN: Rejeter campagne
    CAMPAIGN->>DB: UPDATE campaigns<br/>SET status='REJECTED',<br/>rejection_reason='...'
    CAMPAIGN->>GATEWAY: {status}
    GATEWAY->>NOTIF: Queue: "campaign_rejected"
    NOTIF-->>ONG: Email: "Projet rejeté"<br/>Raison: Docs insuffisants<br/>Action: Résubmit with more docs
    
    Note over ONG,DB: 6️⃣ SUIVI EN TEMPS RÉEL (Admin Dashboard)
    ADMIN->>GATEWAY: GET /admin/dashboard<br/>{view: 'real-time'}
    GATEWAY->>DB: SELECT COUNT(*)<br/>projects_active, donations_today,<br/>ong_verified
    DB-->>GATEWAY: {metrics}
    GATEWAY-->>ADMIN: Affiche: 45 projets actifs,<br/>250M FCFA récoltés,<br/>120 ONG vérifiés